,{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Ocultar detalles"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["0 yuanes; además se ahorra lo que gastaría en suplementos"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Dos estudios de registros estadounidenses analizaron cáncer de mama, próstata, pulmón y colorrectal sin metástasis y tratable. El primero examinó a quienes solo usaban terapias alternativas y no cirugía, radioterapia, quimioterapia ni hormonoterapia. Frente a pacientes comparables con tratamiento estándar, el riesgo de muerte fue 2.5 veces mayor en razón total (HR 2.50, IC 95% 1.88–3.27; un 150% más). En mama, 5.68 veces (3.22–10.04); pulmón, 2.17 (1.42–3.32); colorrectal, 4.57 (1.66–12.61). El segundo estudió terapias complementarias junto al tratamiento estándar. Rechazaron cirugía el 7.0% frente al 0.1%; quimioterapia, 34.1% frente a 3.2%; radioterapia, 53.0% frente a 2.3%; hormonoterapia, 33.7% frente a 2.8%. La supervivencia a 5 años fue 82.2% frente a 86.6%; el riesgo de muerte, 2.08 veces (HR 2.08, 1.50–2.90; aproximadamente el doble). Al ajustar por retrasos y rechazo del tratamiento, la terapia complementaria en sí ya no mostró relación clara con la mortalidad (HR 1.39, 0.83–2.33). Los autores atribuyen el exceso a rechazar tratamiento estándar. El regulador del mercado chino exige que los complementos indiquen: «Los alimentos para la salud no son medicamentos y no sustituyen el tratamiento farmacológico de enfermedades». El NCCIH estadounidense advierte que la hierba de San Juan reduce el efecto de múltiples fármacos, incluida la ciclosporina contra el rechazo de trasplantes y la warfarina anticoagulante."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Fuentes originales"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Johnson SB, Park HS, Gross CP, Yu JB (2018). Use of Alternative Medicine for Cancer and Its Impact on Survival. Journal of the National Cancer Institute, 110(1), 121-124. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jnci/djx145","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/jnci/djx145"]},"；Johnson SB, Park HS, Gross CP, Yu JB (2018). Complementary Medicine, Refusal of Conventional Cancer Therapy, and Survival Among Patients With Curable Cancers. JAMA Oncology, 4(10), 1375-1381. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jamaoncol.2018.2487","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jamaoncol.2018.2487"]},"；国家市场监督管理总局 (2019). 市场监管总局就《保健食品标注警示用语指南》和《保健食品原料目录与保健功能目录管理办法》有关情况举办专题新闻发布会. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/tssps/sjdt/tpxw/art/2023/art_4b658b824b1b4b0ba57c09a56cc93aad.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/tssps/sjdt/tpxw/art/2023/art_4b658b824b1b4b0ba57c09a56cc93aad.html"]},"；National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health (2025). St. John's Wort. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/st-johns-wort","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/st-johns-wort"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jnci/djx145","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Abrir fuente"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Nota del autor"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Solo nivel B. Ambos trabajos se limitan al cáncer, son observacionales de registros, sin asignación a grupos; quienes eligen alternativas pueden diferir en otros aspectos. Sobre abandonar medicación para hipertensión o diabetes, véase apartado 1 (completar la medicación según indicación). Si desea probar un suplemento, informe antes al médico. Sobre pagar por complementos, véase sección 6, apartado 10 (suplementos, preparados y tónicos)."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Mi nota"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Escribe un recordatorio…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a"